WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,020
Who gave you the courage to start dividing my things?

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,820
Sure enough, if there is a sword, it must be yours

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,920
Who stipulated that the rabbit ran to us on his own?

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,420
We saw it first. Why should you take everything from me with just one word?

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:15,220
Okay, according to your logic, whoever sees it counts?

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,020
You've also seen this bow on me and these swords.

7
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,380
Come and get it. Why don't you move?

8
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,880
Seolya, take it. Didn’t it belong to whoever saw it just now?

9
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,080
Why did the rules suddenly become invalid in Driver Su?

10
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:32,720
Enough, this rabbit returns to Suche

11
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:37,380
At least there are people with sane minds. You are lacking a lot.

12
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:39,830
We help you collect and exchange rabbits

13
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,830
Two frames of pine branches and a rabbit

14
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:44,430
You can only take the trees I marked, and the incision cannot be deepened randomly.

15
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,630
Whoever kills the tree doesn't have his share
